    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Naja Salaheem} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
* Examine {p:Imperial Whitegate} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (L-8/9).
** It may be necessary to accept the {q:Divine Interference|Divine Interference|Divine Interference} quest before being able to access the cutscene for this quest.
* Speak to {n:Yoyoroon} in {z:Nashmau} in (G-6).
* Obtain a {@i:Timeworn Talisman|2861} {i:Timeworn Talisman|Timeworn Talisman|2861} to be appraised, along with {@i:Sutlac|5577} {i:Sutlac|Sutlac|5577} and/or {@i:Irmik Helvasi|5572} {i:Irmik Helvasi|Irmik Helvasi|5572} to persuade {n:Yoyoroon}.
** The {i:Timeworn Talisman|Timeworn Talisman|2861} drops from {m:Ephramadian Shades|Ephramadian Shade} in {z:Arrapago Reef} or {z:Caedarva Mire}.
*** Shades may be found west of the {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point}, around (G-10) or near the {p:Survival Guide} for {z:Caedarva Mire}.
*** Talismans obtained prior to starting this quest can be used.
** {i:Sutlac|Sutlac|5577} can be purchased from {n:Yafaaf} (J-12) {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, and {i:Irmik Helvasi|Irmik Helvasi|5572} can be purchased from {n:Fayeewah} (K-12) {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, both NPCs are in the Shararat Teahouse.
*** {n:Yoyoroon} will not accept {i:Sutlac +1|Sutlac +1|5578} or {i:Irmik Helvasi +1|Irmik Helvasi +1|5573}.
* Trade the {i:Timeworn Talisman|Timeworn Talisman|2861} and a {i:Sutlac|Sutlac|5577}, {i:Irmik Helvasi|Irmik Helvasi|5572}, __or even both__ to {n:Yoyoroon} in {z:Nashmau}. There is a chance that his appraisal of the item will fail. Trading both at once along with the talisman gives the highest chance for success.
** Should the appraisal fail, you will have to obtain another {i:Timeworn Talisman|Timeworn Talisman|2861} as well as any food items that you traded him.

* Once your appraisal succeeds, you must zone and talk to {n:Yoyoroon} again to receive the {@k}{k:Talisman of the rebel gods}.
* Examine the {p:Imperial Whitegate} door in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} at (L8/9) for a cutscene to receive the key items: {@k}{k:Talisman key} and {@k}{k:Spatial pressure barometer}.
* Enter {z:Hazhalm Testing Grounds} and examine the **Entry Gate** to view a cutscene.
** This is the same area as {p:Einherjar}. The quickest way is to use the {z:Caedarva Mire} {p:Home Point}.
* Examine the **Entry Gate** again to enter a {p:BCNM}.
** Your opponent will be {p:Odin Prime}, who casts spells such as Paralyze, Dispelga, and elemental magic.
** {p:Odin Prime} will periodically summon an Odin Image, up to three in total.
** Below 50%, Odin Prime may use Zantetsuken, which inflicts Death on all players within a 30' radius. This can be avoided by using /heal or by running out of range.
* After winning the battle, you will enter a cutscene where you will choose your reward.
* Examine {p:Imperial Whitegate} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (L-8/9) for a cutscene.
* Speak to {p:Naja Salaheem} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-10) for a cutscene which completes the quest, along with an {i:Imperial Gold Piece|Imperial Gold Piece|2187}.

=2 Notes
* In the cutscene after defeating Odin, selecting the option "The release of thy knight" on 11 different completions will cause a different cutscene with Odin and at Imperial Whitegate, as well as give a different title for the quest. After that point, all repeats of the Odin Prime battle will be under the quest: {q:A Stygian Pact|A Stygian Pact|A Stygian Pact}.
** Odin, Ovjang, and Mnejing's dialogue will vary after each "release" request.
* This quest can only be repeated once every Earth day (Japanese midnight reset).

